    (uuid "f7ee626a-bf05-4080-8673-99514f75b54a")) 
  (text "I'm not sure this is a good design philosophy, but we care more about noise when we're using eurorack power then USB.\nUSB power is so the module can be publicly demonstrated; eurorack is when people actually make music.\nWe also prioratize running at 5v, hence, no LDO after USB; power is dirtier. FPGA runs off same power as analog on USB, seperate otherwise." 
    (exclude_from_sim no) 
    (at 119.38 -14.732 0) 
